# BYOK. If you're running the whole framework via agent6 (the orchestrator),
# you don't need this file at all - paste your key ONCE into agent6/.env and
# every AI agent (7-10) inherits it automatically.
#
# Only fill this in if you want to run agent10 standalone, without agent6.
# Set ONE of the two below (OpenRouter is checked first if both are set).

# Option A - OpenRouter (default model is free: openai/gpt-oss-20b:free)
# Get a key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b:free   # swap to any "provider/model" id from https://openrouter.ai/models

# Option B - Anthropic Claude
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# Optional: push proactive incident/report notifications to a real chat
# channel. Leave both blank and this agent still works fully via its own
# POST /api/chat endpoint - findings just get recorded locally instead
# (GET /api/notifications).
# SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.slack.com/services/...
# DISCORD_WEBHOOK_URL=https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...

# Optional
# PORT=9099
# LOG_LEVEL=info
